  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n Description \n Paybox integration for the Drupal Commerce payment and checkout system.\n\nThis module carries part of the functionality of the module on Drupal 8/9,\n\nPaybox Service method using Commerce Payment Gateway is implemented here.\n\n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n General requirements \n Required modules\n\n* Drupal Commerce:\n\n * Commerce Payment\n\n Paybox Service specific requirements \n * PHP OpenSSL must be enabled on your server (see documentation for how to enable it).\n\n Back to top \n\n Installation \n * Install Commerce module\n\n* Install Commerce Paybox Payment Module\n\n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n * Add Paybox gateway in admin/commerce/config/payment-gateways/add\n\n* Choice Paybox Plugin\n\n* Testing Data can be found in bank documentation (French doc available only)\n\n Back to top",
